  "body": "## Summary\n\n- 433 hazards whose only direct evidence was blanket mother-law clauses reviewed in 6 sequential passes: 196 gained a specific technical direct clause (201 new links), 237 honestly skipped (mainly the occupational-health series, no matching specific clause in the verified library).\n- Mother-law direct links demoted to supporting per the established convention (215, hashes rebound).\n- Restored 19 link reviews wrongly removed by a filename-based orphan cleanup (the gate indexes reviews by entityId).\n- Gate six-phase PASS (1496 / 1875, strictBlockers=0), validate BLOCKING none, strict audit PASS, bundle verify errors=[].\n- site-selection -> unified-v4-reviewed-20260912-r24.",
